<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65300" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μᾰχ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fit for fighting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀδόντες μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>PA</u>
					662b34
				</span></i>
			; <i>warlike</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. παιδιαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1371a1
				</span></i>
			; of persons, <i>pugnacious</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1381a32
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. περὶ κέρδους</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				1372b31
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ -κή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνη</span>), <i>skill in fighting</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				225a
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -κόν</span> ibid.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἵπποι</span>
			<i>restive</i> horses, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>R.</u>
				467e
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>
			<i>pugnaciously</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				168b
			</span></i>; <i>in a hostile manner</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. διακείμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Cael.</u>
					197.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
